From c5ab1f9d5d8f10a5c2e5a6686994da64159876fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 04:12:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sprint 8: grade-specific diagnostics + coaching placement +
 summer sunset
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New /diagnostic route: grade picker with 6 grade cards (6-11)
- New /diagnostic/grade/[grade] dynamic route with grade-specific
  copy, scope-of-topics box, and pre-filled grade in the form
- New DiagnosticFlow component shared between the picker fallback
  and the per-grade pages
- Placement rules now recommend coaching programs:
  <40% Foundation ($349), 40-70% Acceleration ($549), 70%+ Elite ($799)
- Results UI shows monthly price + cadence next to the program name
- Diagnostic email rewritten to reference coaching programs and
  the cohort model (was: summer clinics)
- Summer clinic promo removed from homepage — replaced with a
  free-diagnostic grade grid + grade picker CTA
- Summer nav link replaced with 'Free Diagnostic' (desktop + mobile)
- Migration 00048 adds ~28 questions across grade bands 9-10 and
  10-11 so grades 9, 10, and 11 have real content to draw from
- /summer page and admin summer-waitlist remain live but unpromoted
